  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 1818 K, melting point of Tm; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 4.025$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 8.485 + 0.264 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.910 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$$\n\\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2, 9, 8} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 4 8 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 1 3 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 9 1 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 8 4 7\n$$\nFormation equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-1818 K: $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -7.148 - 0.451 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 1.153 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 114.800 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$$\n\\Delta G f ^ {\\circ} = - 7. 1 4 8 + 0. 4 5 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 1. 1 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 5 7. 4 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2 1. 3 6 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}\n$$\n1818-2000 K: $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -6.259 - 5.020 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.119 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 68.400 T^{-1}$ \n$$\n\\Delta G f ^ {0} = - 6. 2 5 9 + 5. 0 2 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 1 1 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 3 4. 2 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 5 4. 2 6 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}\n$$\nSource: Data from Pedley (396) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 1818 K, melting point of Tm; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 4.025$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 8.485 + 0.264 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.910 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$$",
      "\\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2, 9, 8} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 4 8 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 1 3 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 9 1 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 8 4 7",
      "$$",
      "Formation equations (kcal/mol):",
